# The app (frontend/) needs no environment variables and holds no secrets: everything it shows comes from the API.
# Copy to frontend/.env only if you want to change the setting below.

# --- Local development (pnpm dev) ---
# Where the dev server forwards /api and /o. Change it if your API runs on another port.
# API_URL=http://localhost:8000

# --- Production (Vercel) ---
# Not set here. The backend's address is in frontend/vercel.json ("rewrites"): Vercel forwards /api and /o to it,
# so the browser only ever talks to one address and the sign-in cookie keeps working.
# Change "https://coinvoy.onrender.com" there to your real backend address.
#
# The deploy pipeline (.github/workflows/deploy-frontend.yml, run by hand from the Actions tab) needs three secrets in
# the GitHub "production" environment, not .env values:
# VERCEL_TOKEN, VERCEL_ORG_ID, VERCEL_PROJECT_ID (see the README's Deployment section).
